WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.6 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Build your work plan and Gantt

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A Gantt shows timing; capacity and dependencies show whether the plan can work.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give every task an owner, start and finish.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check overlaps against capacity and dependencies.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Change dates by recorded decision, not by tidying.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: Brian updates the Gantt monthly; any milestone moving over two weeks goes to Achieng and into the decision log.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your Gantt and a schedule review rule.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
